DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Mann, siehst du aus, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gib's zu, du hast dich mit Bienen
angelegt, oder?
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich sag's ja immer:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Schlafende Bienenstöcke sollte man
definitiv lieber ruhen lassen.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Hala!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¿Qué te ha pasado en la cara?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Da escalofríos verte!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¡Qué habrás estado haciendo para
que las abejas te hayan picado de
esa manera!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Quando vedi un alveare cadere da
un albero,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ti conviene non perdere
tempo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Scappa a gambe levate
verso l'edificio più vicino{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ed entraci subito!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Se proprio vuoi prendere l'alveare,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tieniti pront{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a tirare fuori il retino
più velocemente possibile!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Se vai in giro a scuotere alberi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
devi prepararti al peggio.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Ağaçtan kovan düşünce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} tereddüt edersen
bedelini AĞIR ödersin.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Kaçacaksan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
en yakın binaya dal.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Yakalamaya kalkacaksan da,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ağını yıldırım gibi çıkarman
lazım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ağaç sallıyorsan,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} olacaklara
hazır olacaksın.

EN:
It hurts my face just looking at you!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Take some medicine and get better,
QUICK,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
¡Me duele la cara solo de verte!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Necesitas tomarte la medicina,
¡y rapidico,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
Sto male solamente a guardarti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Prendi la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} e rimettiti
presto, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
Your good looks are wasted when
you spend time looking like that!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Go get some medicine already!

ES:
¿De qué te sirve ser tan guap{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
si vas por ahí con ese careto?{{TAG:0003:0001:}} ¡Ve
y tómate ya una medicina para eso!

IT:
Sei belloccio, ma con questa faccia
nessuno se ne può accorgere!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Prendi subito la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

Essere carine come te non serve
a molto con questa faccia pesta!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Prendi la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
